          "html": "Why choose a cube sauna?",
          "text": "Why choose a cube sauna?"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "html": "A cube sauna's flat roof and square footprint make the most of small yards, decks and patios, and the large glass fronts turn your yard into the view. They heat evenly, look at home beside modern architecture, and install on a simple level base.",
